# Open Business Case Bench
#
#   cp .env.example .env    then paste your key below
#
# One OpenRouter key covers every model call the pipeline makes — construction,
# solving, and judging. Create one at https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# .env is git-ignored, and anything already set in your shell wins over it.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=


# Everything else has a working default and is configured through OBCB_* environment
# variables. To see every setting and its resolved value:
#
#   uv run obcb config          # grouped, human-readable
#   uv run obcb config --json   # machine-readable
#
# The variable names and defaults live in src/obcb/config.py, each with a comment on
# what it affects. Set any of them here if you want them persisted.
